<title>USA: Northern Ill. University yields 5.85 pct in 2022.</title>
<headline>Northern Ill. University yields 5.85 pct in 2022.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets Inc said Thursday it tentatively priced $50 million Board of Trustees of Northern Illinois University bonds at a top yield of 5.85 percent in 2022.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
<p>THE BOARD OF TRUSTEES OF</p>
<p>NORTHERN ILLINOIS UNIVERSITY</p>
<p>RE: $49,990,000*</p>
